      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC9739928::web::003::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposed TiN/Al2O3 coating and adhesion interlayer will form a dense, adherent multilayer with a graded interfacial region on Ti-6Al-4V.",
