      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC11509624::web::015::3_3_hardness_and_wear_analysis"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Keeping the substrate below 500 degrees Celsius during deposition will preserve the Ti-6Al-4V microstructure.",
      "field": "conditions",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "TiN layers provide high hardness and wear resistance.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Al2O3 layers and the optimized interlayer enhance toughness and barrier properties.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The layered coating disperses mechanical stresses.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC11509624::web::015::3_3_hardness_and_wear_analysis"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The coating acts as a barrier to corrosive species.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Alternating TiN and Al2O3 layers retard crack propagation.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Alternating TiN and Al2O3 layers retard diffusion of aggressive species.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The coated Ti-6Al-4V surface will have higher hardness than untreated Ti-6Al-4V.",
